@api = http://localhost:5000

### Health check: 200
GET {{api}}/

### Danh muc sach: 200
GET {{api}}/api/books

### Tim sach theo ten: 200
GET {{api}}/api/books?q=code

### Chi tiet sach: 200
GET {{api}}/api/books/1

### Sach khong ton tai: 404
GET {{api}}/api/books/999

### Dat muon hop le: 201; sao chep id tu response de thu GET o duoi
POST {{api}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "studentName": "Nguyen Van A"
}

### Du lieu khong hop le: 400
POST {{api}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 0,
  "studentCode": "",
  "studentName": ""
}

### Dat muon sach da het ban: 409 (sach id 4 mac dinh het)
POST {{api}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 4,
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "studentName": "Nguyen Van A"
}

### Doc yeu cau: thay GUID bang id nhan duoc tu POST de duoc 200; GUID gia de duoc 404
GET {{api}}/api/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
